The complete canonical inventory and per-entry source references are in
`data/registers.json`. Definitions with source-limited evidence retain their
evidence/access qualifications. Writable and reserved masks are separate;
read-only bits are not classified as reserved. The inventory records source
disagreement decisions and unresolved scope limitations explicitly.

